    "chunk_text": "u sy Godes sunu sege \u00feisum stane \u00fe\u00e6t he to hlafe gewur\u00f0e. \u00d0a andswarude him se H\u00e6lend, Hit is awriten \u00fe\u00e6t se man ne leofa\u00fe be hlafe anum, ac of \u00e6lcum Godes And \u00fea l\u00e6dde se deofol hyne, & \u00e6tywde him ealle ricu eor\u00f0an ymbehwyrftes, on anre byrhmhwile & Witodlice ealle hig beo\u00f0 \u00feine gif \u00feu geea\u00f0metst beforan me. \u00dea andswarode him se h\u00e6lend, Hit is awriten, Drihten \u00feinne God \u00f0u geeadmetst, & him anum \u00feeowast. \u00d0a l\u00e6dde he hyne on Hierusalem & gesette hine ofer \u00fe\u00e6s temples hricg, & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gyf \u00feu sy So\u00f0lice hyt is awriten, \u00f0\u00e6t he hys englum be \u00fee bebyt \u00fe\u00e6t hig \u00fee gehealdon, & \u00fe\u00e6t hig \u00fee mid \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend him andswariende, Hyt is gecweden, ne costa \u00feu Drihten \u00feinne god. & ealre \u00fe\u00e6re costunge gefylledre, se deofol him sume hwile fram gewat. \u00dea ferde se h\u00e6lend on gastes m\u00e6gene on Galileam, & his hlisa be him ferde on eall \u00fe\u00e6t rice, & he \u00d0a com he to Nazareth, \u00fear he afed w\u00e6s, & he eode on rested\u00e6ge on \u00fea gesamnunge \u00e6fter his & him w\u00e6s geseald Isaias boc \u00fe\u00e6s witegan & sona swa he \u00fea boc unfeold \u00fea funde he \u00fear awriten, And \u00fea he \u00fea boc befeold he hig \u00feam \u00f0ene agef & s\u00e6t, & ealra heora eagan on \u00fe\u00e6re gesamnunge \u00d0a",
